# EXAMPLE guard.paths — copy this into the vault, do not run it from the skill folder.
#
# Protected source-of-truth files, as globs relative to the vault root passed as
# `--root`. Any change to a file listed here requires explicit human
# confirmation; `guard check` makes an unauthorised change loud, it does not
# prevent one.
#
# Install at `4-SYSTEM/scripts/day-package/guard.paths` in the vault; the lock
# file (`guard.lock`) is written beside it and is generated, never hand-edited.
# Ship the paths file; never ship a lock file — its hashes belong to one vault.

3-TRANSFORMATIONS/Day-Packages/<source-stream>/*/*.md
3-TRANSFORMATIONS/Day-Packages/<target-stream>/*/*.md
3-TRANSFORMATIONS/Day-Packages/<source-stream>/_TEMPLATE.md
3-TRANSFORMATIONS/Day-Packages/<source-stream>/_TERMBASE.md
4-SYSTEM/scripts/day-package/day_package_tools.py
4-SYSTEM/scripts/day-package/reorder_commentators.py

# Notes
# - Use chapter-agnostic globs so a new chapter's files are picked up
#   automatically and this file never needs editing when the plan grows.
# - A glob that matches nothing is silently empty; check `guard record`'s count
#   after adding a line.
